# ========== Secrets ==========
# Pro-license signing toolchain — do NOT commit. The keypair is generated locally
# and must stay out of version control. Runtime license verification uses a
# hardcoded public key in the Rust source, so none of these files are needed to
# build or run. Rotate the keypair if it was ever committed.
src/inference-worker/developer_private_key.pem
src/inference-worker/developer_public_key.pem
src/inference-worker/license_gen.py

